flowchart TB
  F["UEFI firmware with OneMind db key<br/>(enrolled at the factory on every x86 box)"] --> U["Signed UKI per slot<br/>kernel + initrd + command line in one file"]
  U --> V["Root filesystem checked block by block<br/>(dm-verity, read-only A/B slot)"]
  U --> TPM["TPM unseals the data key only if<br/>PCR 7 (Secure Boot state) + signed PCR 11 match"]
  TPM --> D["LUKS2 data partition<br/>(encrypted from first boot; PCR 15 volume check)"]
  V --> E["Extensions: signed-only sysext / confext<br/>driver packs with module.sig_enforce=1"]
  V --> K["k3s hardened profile<br/>secrets encryption · audit · Pod Security"]
  K --> G["Capability gateway<br/>human approval for motion, updates,<br/>installs and data export"]
  G --> A["Apps and AI agents<br/>(least privilege, sandboxed)"]
  R["Release signing: offline root · 2-of-3 signers ·<br/>manifest expiry · revocation · anti-downgrade (SBAT)"] -.-> U
  R -.-> E
